ELINE SNAPSHOT` block 'verbatim in the payload's `pipelineSnapshot` field, unmodified and untruncated', which directly contradicts the Technical Constraints rule that `pipelineSnapshot` is truncated to cap the total POST body at 16KB. (7) Task 6's Contract instructs step 11 to read `.flow-tmp/followups-block.txt` from the worktree after `flow-remove-worktree --delete-branch` completes, which is impossible because the worktree has just been deleted, and also introduces a step-11 call site and follow-ups payload input not defined in Scope Boundary, Architecture Decisions, or Tasks 1–2.",
