      "why": "Task 5's Acceptance criteria requires embedding the up-to-64KB `PIPELINE SNAPSHOT` block 'verbatim in the payload's `pipelineSnapshot` field, unmodified and untruncated', which directly contradicts the Technical Constraints requirement that `pipelineSnapshot` is truncated to keep the total webhook POST body capped at 16KB."
